<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equated to FOB Omaha Basis as of 3:00 PM and compared to Monday's 3:00 PM close, fresh loins were steady to weak; butts mostly steady; sknd. hams 17-20 lbs. generally steady to 1.00 lower, 20-26 lbs. firm; sdls. bellies</p>
<p>14-16 lbs. 1.00-4.00 higher. Trading was slow, with light demand</p>
<p>and offerings. -- USDA Market News</p>
